# Beauty Bliss Sales Tracker — Cursor Project Rules

Daily sales-entry app for beauty-counter Beauty Advisors (BAs), plus a management dashboard. BAs submit units + amount per brand per POS per day, plus GWP (Gift-With-Purchase) counts tied to active promotions. Management views trends, promotion performance, incentives, and POS/brand breakdowns.

---

## CRITICAL (read first)

1. **`shared/schema.ts` is the single source of truth.** Define every entity as a Drizzle table there, derive the Zod insert schema with `createInsertSchema`, and export inferred `Insert*` / `Select*` types. Client and server both import from `@shared/schema` — never redefine a shape locally. When adding a field: update `shared/schema.ts` first, then `npm run db:push`, then UI/API.
2. **API error shape is `{ status: number, error: string, details?: unknown }`.** Send it with the matching HTTP status. Success responses return the resource JSON directly.
3. **`package.json` and `package-lock.json` must stay in sync.** After any dependency change, run `npm install` locally and commit the lock file. Railway uses `npm ci` and will fail on drift.
4. **Auth is already implemented.** PIN login + `express-session`. Roles: `ba`, `part_time`, `management`. Do not remove auth or make BA entry / dashboard public again. Protect routes with `requireAuth` / `requireManagement`. Exception: a few server-to-server promotion endpoints stay unauthenticated (see Guardrails).
5. **Do not swap the router, ORM, or UI library** without a written proposal. Do not add Redux / Zustand / Jotai.

---

## Stack

| Layer | Technology | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Runtime | Node.js 22.x | Railway default |
| Language | TypeScript 5.x | Strict mode, ESM (`"type": "module"`) |
| Backend | Express 5.x | Routes in `server/routes.ts` under `/api/*` |
| Frontend | React 18.3 | Functional components only |
| Routing | wouter 3.x | Hash-based (`useHashLocation`). Do **not** add react-router |
| Build | Vite (client) + `script/build.ts` (esbuild server → `dist/index.cjs`) | |
| Styling | Tailwind 3.x + `tailwindcss-animate` + `tw-animate-css` | Rose accent `340 65% 47%` |
| UI | shadcn/ui on Radix | Do **not** hand-edit `client/src/components/ui/` |
| Data fetching | TanStack Query 5.x | Server state only |
| Forms | react-hook-form + `@hookform/resolvers` + Zod | Bind to `@shared/schema` Zod schemas |
| Validation | Zod 3.24 + `drizzle-zod` + `zod-validation-error` | |
| ORM | Drizzle ORM 0.39 | |
| Database | PostgreSQL 15+ via `pg` | `PgStorage` when `DATABASE_URL` is set |
| Fallback storage | In-memory `MemStorage` | Dev / no-DB only |
| Session | `express-session` + `connect-pg-simple` (prod) / MemoryStore (dev) | Set up in `server/index.ts` after storage init |
| Auth | PIN hashed with `bcryptjs`; session cookie | |
| CSV | `csv-parse/sync` 6.x | `relax_column_count: true` |
| Charts | Recharts 2.x | |
| Icons | lucide-react | |
| Deploy | Railway | `npm ci` → `npm run build` → `npm start` |

**Scripts:** `npm run dev` (tsx watch), `npm run build` (client + server bundle), `npm start` (production), `npm run check` (tsc), `npm run db:push` (drizzle-kit).

